{
  "name": "r2_session_control",
  "how": "Frozen dinov2-small features (CLS + mean patch) of masked seed crops (data/crops/manifest.csv), harness.FrozenLogReg (StandardScaler + balanced multinomial logistic regression). Fit on split=train (all crops), C chosen from [0.01, 0.03, 0.1, 0.3, 1.0, 3.0] by macro F1 on split=val eval_rep crops, refit on train, scored once on split=test eval_rep crops (one per original photo for soybean, one per near-duplicate cluster for Lin). 95% CIs: percentile bootstrap over groups, 2000 resamples, seed 0. Groups: soybean = 30 s capture bursts (split is burst-level), Lin = near-duplicate clusters. Rows with multi_seed=True are excluded from val and test scoring (kept in train). SESSION CONTROL OVERRIDES THE SPLIT: soybean insect_hole vs sound only, binary, evaluated by grouped 5-fold CV over bursts (StratifiedGroupKFold, seed 0; C from [0.01, 0.1, 1] by inner grouped 3-fold CV), out-of-fold predictions on eval_rep crops pooled, burst bootstrap CIs. Arms: all backgrounds; white/light background; light background and capture days 13-14/08 only (the only days with both classes: the honest hole result); the same two arms restricted to mask_frac >= 0.2 (zoomed-out black-background photos give upsampled, blurrier crops); every arm also reports soybean_by_mask_frac (< 0.2 vs >= 0.2); cross-session (train holes from 9-11/08 only, test holes from 13-14/08 only, light background; 9-11/08 training holes from any background; sound light background, burst folds). date_probe: within one class and light background, binary probe predicting capture session, same grouped CV, AUC with grouped bootstrap CI.",
